Commit:     Brendan Abolivier <brendan@thunderbird.net>
CommitDate: Thu Apr 30 23:33:58 2026 +0000

    Bug 2033084 - Integrate the OperationQueue in the Graph client. r=jtracey,edicharry

    This commit:

    * Makes `OperationSender` take `http::Request` rather than only the request body
    * Makes `XpComGraphClient` use the `OperationSender` as the one source of truth
      regarding the server's URI - and, as a nitpick, changes the terminology in
      graph_xpcom to use `base_url` since we use it as a base to build a request's
      final endpoint
    * Makes `XpComGraphClient` use the `OperationQueue` to schedule requests

    Regarding the `OperationRequestOptions` for each request, this copies what we
    already use for corresponding EWS operations.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D297345

